    "language": "he",
    "printed_quote": "זֶה דּוֹר דֹּרְשָׁיו מְבַקְשֵׁי פָנֶיךָ יַעֲקֹב סֶלָה:",
    "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/6",
    "local_verse": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/psalm_24/psalms_24/6"
  },
  {
    "stem": "torah_return_psalm_24",
    "language": "he",
    "printed_quote": "שְׂאוּ שְׁעָרִים רָאשֵׁיכֶם וְהִנָּשְׂאוּ פִּתְחֵי עוֹלָם וְיָבוֹא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד:",
